The problem statements and reference implementations here are original, but many
challenges are inspired by, or restate, well-known problems and algorithms whose
authorship belongs upstream. Attribution is given here at the source-pool level;
the exact per-challenge citation — including solution-bearing papers, textbook
sections, and named algorithms — lives in each challenge's HINTS.md so it does
not spoil the problem in README.md. Every citation URL in this repo was checked
to resolve at the time of writing.

